        "original_id": "f47185d4-41b7-5e74-811f-671d9ff93dd3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: To Catch a Predator, Dateline NBC, Now with Tom Brokaw and Katie Couric\n- People: Chris Hansen, Tom Brokaw, Katie Couric\n- Topics: ages of consent in North America, hidden camera investigations, Internet sex predator sting operations\n\nFacts:\n- Now with Tom Brokaw and Katie Couric was eventually merged into Dateline NBC.\n- To Catch a Predator was an American reality television series that featured hidden camera investigations by Dateline NBC.\n- To Catch a Predator focused on impersonating underage people, generally ages 13 to 15, and detaining adult men who contacted them online for sexual liaisons.\n- Chris Hansen was known for his work on Dateline NBC, especially the former segment To Catch a Predator.\n- Chris Hansen's To Catch a Predator work involved sting operations targeting potential Internet sex predators.\n- Ages of consent in North America vary by jurisdiction.",
